{"ref":"BDB, אַכְזָר²","hw":"אַכְזָר²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַכְזָר</span></big>  <strong>adj. cruel, fierce</strong>, of poison <span dir=\"rtl\">(רֹאשׁ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:33\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.33\">Dt 32:33</a>; elsewhere of men, <em>fierce</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:2\" href=\"/Job.41.2\">Jb 41:2</a>; as subst. = <em>a cruel one</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:21\" href=\"/Job.30.21\">Jb 30:21</a> (of God), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">La 4:3</a>.","next":"BDB, אַכְזָרִי","prev":"BDB, כזר"}